{"ref":"BDB, יָרָק","hw":"יָרָק","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">יָרָק</span></big>  <strong>n.</strong>[<strong>m.</strong>] <strong>herbs</strong> (coll.), <strong>herbage</strong> (green, greens)—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">יָרָק</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 11:10\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.11.10\">Dt 11:10</a> + 2 times; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">יְרַק</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 37:27\" href=\"/Isaiah.37.27\">Is 37:27</a> = <a data-ref=\"II Kings 19:26\" href=\"/II_Kings.19.26\">2 K 19:26</a>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">גַּן־יָרָק</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 11:10\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.11.10\">Dt 11:10</a> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 21:2\" href=\"/I_Kings.21.2\">1 K 21:2</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲרֻחַת יָרָק</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 15:17\" href=\"/Proverbs.15.17\">Pr 15:17</a>; as subst., <span dir=\"rtl\">יְרַק דֶּשֶׁא</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 37:27\" href=\"/Isaiah.37.27\">Is 37:27</a> = <a data-ref=\"II Kings 19:26\" href=\"/II_Kings.19.26\">2 K 19:26</a> <em>green shoots of grass</em> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">עֵשֶׂב שָׂדֶה</span>, etc.)","next":"BDB, יַרְקוֹן","prev":"BDB, יֶ֫רֶק"}